@1100=~Travel while the main character is petrified (Experimental, may not work)~
@1200=~NPC Bodies Death Cam (like cdtweaks' Death Cam, but a petrified main character does not end the game)~
@1000=~Greater Restoration cures Raise Dead Constitution penalties~
@1001=~Removes 1 stack per casting~
@1002=~Removes 2 stacks per casting~
@1003=~Removes 3 stacks per casting~
@1004=~Removes all stacks~
@601=~I once traveled with a companion who died and is no longer in my party. Please, bring them to me so that I might see them returned to life.~
@602=~I have the remains of a fallen companion that have decayed beyond the ability to be raised. I wish to have them resurrected.~ // no longer referenced by ejtemple-single.d as of the Component 600 rewrite; left in place in case older compiled dialogue still points to it
